# HookBox worker secrets / vars template.
# Copy to `.dev.vars` for local `wrangler dev`, and set the same names in
# Cloudflare (Workers → Settings → Variables and Secrets) or via
# `wrangler secret put AUTH_PEPPER` for production.
#
# AUTH_PEPPER (required, secret)
#   Server-side pepper used to derive inbox token hashes (HMAC-SHA256) and IP
#   hashes. Without it, a leaked database would let an attacker verify guessed
#   tokens offline. Use at least 32 random bytes; rotating it invalidates every
#   existing inbox token.
AUTH_PEPPER=

# PUBLIC_ORIGIN (optional, plain var)
#   Overrides the origin used to build webhook URLs, e.g. https://hookbox.example.com
#   Defaults to the origin of the incoming request.
PUBLIC_ORIGIN=
